{"id":"88898ebf913a1fd0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-addition-join.md","title":"Addition Gives the Solovay Join","display":"thm-solovay-addition-join — Addition Gives the Solovay Join","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-addition-join","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-addition-join"],"display":"thm-solovay-addition-join — Addition Gives the Solovay Join","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-thm-solovay-difference]]","[[43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.4.1, addition part","source_printed_pages":"346","source_pdf_pages":"366","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-addition-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-addition-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-addition-join — Addition Gives the Solovay Join"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ef82b54a29317e0\" href=\"?note=9ef82b54a29317e0\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-difference\">43-thm-solovay-difference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adf027c4fe144150\" href=\"?note=adf027c4fe144150\" title=\"43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic\">43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.4.1, addition part"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"346"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"366"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>，差分刻画见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ef82b54a29317e0\" href=\"?note=9ef82b54a29317e0\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-difference\">43-thm-solovay-difference</a>，左 c.e. 加法闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"adf027c4fe144150\" href=\"?note=adf027c4fe144150\" title=\"43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic\">43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le_S\\alpha+\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\alpha+\\beta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\le_S\\alpha+\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\alpha+\\beta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\alpha\\le_S\\gamma\\land\\beta\\le_S\\gamma\\bigr)\\iff\\alpha+\\beta\\le_S\\gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\alpha\\le_S\\gamma\\land\\beta\\le_S\\gamma\\bigr)\\iff\\alpha+\\beta\\le_S\\gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由差分刻画，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha+\\beta)-\\alpha=\\beta\">\\((\\alpha+\\beta)-\\alpha=\\beta\\)</span> 为左 c.e.，故两项均归约到和。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\\gamma-\\alpha\">\\(c_0\\gamma-\\alpha\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_1\\gamma-\\beta\">\\(c_1\\gamma-\\beta\\)</span> 为左 c.e.，相加可得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(c_0+c_1)\\gamma-(\\alpha+\\beta)\">\\((c_0+c_1)\\gamma-(\\alpha+\\beta)\\)</span> 为左 c.e.，于是和归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>。反向若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\gamma-(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\delta\">\\(c\\gamma-(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\delta\\)</span> 为左 c.e.，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\gamma-\\alpha=\\beta+\\delta\">\\(c\\gamma-\\alpha=\\beta+\\delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\gamma-\\beta=\\alpha+\\delta\">\\(c\\gamma-\\beta=\\alpha+\\delta\\)</span> 也为左 c.e.，再次应用差分刻画。此论证适用于负实数，未照抄原书“乘法也是join”的无退化边界说法：零乘非可计算数不能给出相同join。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.4.1, addition part；印刷页 346，PDF 页 366。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-solovay-difference","status":"resolved","id":"9ef82b54a29317e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"adf027c4fe144150","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-left-ce-arithm