"正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]] — Addition Gives the Solovay Join"},{"id":"5c7f032a842f6b9a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-complete]]，加法上确界采用 [[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]。"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40","9ef82b54a29317e0","adf027c4fe144150"]}